* LOAD_CTRL from MCP4725\n(control board, 0-4.096 V)
* V_SET = LOAD_CTRL / 16\n(0 - 0.256 V per channel)\nCset: 9.4 us slew filter
* Sotp: LM339 #2 open-collector\nover-temp pull-down\n(Votp = 0 V: open)
* Sdrop = LM339 #3 (open collector): holds KILL low while\nV(DRAIN) > 0.5 V.  DUT absent / collapsed -> KILL = 12 V ->\nDk/Rk lift every In- -> all gates to 0 V (no wind-up).\nDRAIN and KILL reach here by net label.
* CH1
* CH2
* CH3
* CH4
* ISEN to STM32 ADC\n(1k + 10n, clamped\n to 3V3 by BAT54S)
* ISEN: AVG = mean of the 4 source voltages = I_total x Rs / 4\nV(ISEN) = 0.30 V/A + 0.12 V offset (3.19 V at 10.24 A)
* F1 15 A fast\n(5 mR)
* DUT lead pair (+ side lumped)
* DUT (PSU / battery under test)
* Snubber: damps\nlead L vs Coss
* VSEN to STM32 ADC\n(1k + 10n, clamped\n to 3V3 by BAT54S)
* DUT- sense\n(= board GND at\nthe DUT- terminal)
* VSEN = 0.049 x (V(DUT+) - V(DUT-)) + 0.085 V\n3.0 V at 59 V, ADC clips at 65 V
* Rails from the control board\n(16-pin connector P1)
* DC LOAD Rev E - ANALOG STAGE - 06 HARDWARE CV MODE (current-source DUT)
* Each channel: TLV9154 (1/4, TI model = TLV9152) forces V(Sn) = V_SET, so I_ch = V_SET / Rs  (Rs = 2 x 0.2R 2512 in parallel).\nDz (6.8 V) limits wind-up; Dk/Rk let the dropout detector force the op-amp low; Rb (15Meg) = +2.6 mV offset -> 0 A at V_SET = 0.\nRf/Cc = 3.3k/1n integrator, Rg = 47R.  I_total = 4 x V_SET / 0.1 = 2.5 A per volt of LOAD_CTRL (10.24 A full scale).\nCV: V_DUT below CV_SET -> U7 output rises -> Mcv pulls V_SET down -> load sinks less. CV_SET = 0: U7 low, Mcv off, plain CC.
.param fet=1 Rs=0.1 Llead=1u
.step param Cx list 1p 47u
.step param Isrc list 0.1 1 8
.tran 0 150m 0 10u
.meas TRAN v_12V FIND V(DUT+) AT 59m
.meas TRAN vpp_12V PP V(DUT+) FROM 50m TO 59m
.meas TRAN vpk_Istep MAX V(DUT+) FROM 60m TO 99m
.meas TRAN v_after_Istep FIND V(DUT+) AT 99m
.meas TRAN v_10V FIND V(DUT+) AT 149m
.meas TRAN vpp_10V PP V(DUT+) FROM 140m TO 149m
.meas TRAN Iload FIND (I(Rs1)+I(Rs2)+I(Rs3)+I(Rs4)) AT 149m
.model M2N7002 VDMOS(Rg=3 Vto=1.6 Rd=0.2 Rs=0.5 Kp=0.16 Cgdmax=30p Cgdmin=5p Cgs=20p Cjo=10p Is=1p ksubthres=.1)
.model DCL D(Is=1n N=0.1 Rs=1)
.include ../../lib/fet_models.lib
.include ../../lib/tlv915x.lib
.model SWOTP SW(Ron=2 Roff=1G Vt=1 Vh=0)    ; LM339 + 2N7002 pull-down
.model SWDROP SW(Ron=50 Roff=1G Vt=0 Vh=50m) ; LM339 output, 50 mV hysteresis
.include ../../lib/misc_models.lib
* TEST: current-source DUT (30 V compliance) with CV set to 12 V, LOAD_CTRL ramped 0 -> full scale over 20 ms.\nAt 60 ms the source steps +10 %, at 100 ms CV_SET steps to 10 V.\nEXPECT: V(DUT+) settles to the CV setting with no sustained oscillation for 0.1 - 8 A, with and without 47 uF across the DUT.
.backanno
.end
